          "reason": "The current role is a read-only profile property: all nonempty names in assignRolesIdsInfo are displayed as assigned business roles, and identity/assigned roles come from the authenticated staff session and Personal Center. A displayed or claimed role is not an assigned role, and role names alone do not establish page, action or record permissions.",
